Name: signflinger
Short Name: signflinger
Version: N/A
Revision: DEPS
Update Mechanism: Autoroll
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: No
Shipped: no
URL: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/tools/base/+/refs/heads/mirror-goog-studio-main/signflinger/

Description:
Library from the Android Gradle Plugin that combines zipflinger (fast zip
creation) with apksig (APK signing) so that an APK can be created and signed in
a single pass. The CIPD package contains signflinger.jar (a fat jar bundling
zipflinger, apksig, and the Chromium-authored org.chromium.build.ZipBuilder
main class from java/) as well as a GraalVM native-image executable
(signflinger, for Linux x86_64 hosts with x86-64-v3 + SHA-NI), used by
//build/android/gyp/apkbuilder.py and //build/android/gyp/dex.py.

Local Modifications:
None

What version is this:
  * Run print_version.sh to find out the version.
  * New instances are uploaded by the packager bot:
    https://ci.chromium.org/p/chromium/builders/ci/3pp-linux-amd64-packager
  * The bot autoruns every 6 hours. Ping a trooper or a clank-build-core@ dev to
    trigger it if you need it sooner:
    https://luci-scheduler.appspot.com/jobs/chromium/3pp-linux-amd64-packager
